{"translation":{"id":"gaz_ebi","name":"ክታበ ቁልቁሉ, Biblica® ሂካ አመያ በነማ ሃራ, ሎቆደ ዽኣ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=gaze","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=gaze","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"EBI","englishName":"West Central Oromo Bible","language":"gaz","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"f3eeb22163e62abd4aeeda7f1c58a68dfa1fff2482db437ee160fb95280d59e5","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31102,"languageName":"Oromoo","languageEnglishName":"Oromo"},"book":{"id":"JOB","translationId":"gaz_ebi","name":"እዮብ","commonName":"እዮብ","title":"ክታበ እዮብ","order":18,"numberOfChapters":42,"sha256":"af3cbffdea372204dce76f6203c5eb51a175b29739f2a28f0efa756749af37e4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/JOB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":42,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/JOB/42.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1070},"chapter":{"number":16,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["እዮብ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["እዮብስ አከነ ጄዼ ዴብሴ፦"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"“አን ዋን አከና ባይኤ ዸገኤረ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ሁንድኬሰን ጀጀቤስቶተ ነመ ዽጵስተኒዸ!","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"ሃሳን ፋይዳ ህንቀብኔ ኩን ህንዹሙ?","poem":1},{"text":"ወን አከ አት ኦዱ ዼሬስቱፍ ስ ቱቱቁ ማል?","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"ኡቱ እስን እዶኮ ጅራተኒ","poem":1},{"text":"ስላ አን አኩመኬሰን ከነ ነንዱበዸ ቱሬ፤","poem":2},{"text":"ዱቢ ምኦፍቱ ዱበቹዻንስ","poem":1},{"text":"መታኮ እስንት ነንራሰን ቱሬ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"አን አፋንኮቲን እስን ጀጀቤሴ","poem":1},{"text":"ጎርስ አረበኮቲስ ቀበነ እስኒ ኬነ ቱሬ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"“ዮ አን ዱበዼ ዹኩብንኮ ነት ህንወያኡ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ጨል ጄዹስ ነ ህንዺሱ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"ያ ዋቅ፣ አት ዹጉማን ነ ደዸብሲፍቴርተ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ወረ መነኮ ጅሩ ሁንደስ በሌስቴርተ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"አት ነ ኮኮቴስቴ፤ ኩንስ ረጋ ነት ተኤ፤","poem":1},{"text":"አከ መሌ ሁቀቹንኮስ እፈት በኤ ነ ሳጥሌ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"ዋቅን ዼከምሰሳቲን ሩኩቴ ነ ጭጭሬ፤","poem":1},{"text":"እልካንሳ ነት ቀረቴ፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ዲንኮ እጀሳ ነት በባሴ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"ነሞትን ነት ቆሱፍ አፋን በነተን፤","poem":1},{"text":"ቱፊዻን መዲኮ ከበለን፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ቶኮ ተአኒ ነት ከአን።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"ዋቅንስ ደበርሴ ሀሞተት ነ ኬኔ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ሀርከ ጀልኦታ ኬሰስ ነ ቡሴ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"አን ነጋን ጅራቻን ቱሬ፤ እን ገሩ ነ ቡርኩቴሴ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ሞርመ ነ ቀቤ ነ ጨጨብሴ።","poem":2},{"text":"ጥዬፈትናሳስ ነ ጎዸቴ፤","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"ሎልቶትንሳ ወር ጥያን ሎለን ነ መርሱ።","poem":2},{"text":"እን ገረ ላፍነ መሌ ከሌኮ ወራኔ","poem":1},{"text":"ሀዾፍቱኮሌ ለፈት ገድ ጅግሴ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"እን አሙማ አመ ነ ጨጨብሰ፤","poem":1},{"text":"አኩመ ሎልቱ ቶኮት ነት ፊገ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"“አን ጎጋኮት ኡፈተ ገዳ ሆዸዼረ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ጋንፈኮስ ብዮ ኬሰት አዋሌረ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"ፉልኮ ቦእቻን ዲመቴረ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ዱከን ልምጢንስ እጀኮረ ቡኤረ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"ተኡስ ሀርክኮ የከ ቶኮሌ ህንሆጄትኔ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ከዸናንኮስ ቁልቁሉዸ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"“ያ ለፈ፣ አት ዺገኮ ህንዾክስን፤","poem":1},{"text":"አከ እይኮ እዶ ቦቆና አርገቱስ ህንጎዽን!","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"አመዩ ዹገ በኣንኮ ሰሚረ ጅረ፤","poem":1},{"text":"አቡካቶትንኮስ ኦል ጉባ ጅረ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"ምቾትንኮ ነ ቱፈቱ፤","poem":1},{"text":"እጅኮስ እምማን ገረ ዋቃት ፈጫሰ፤","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"አኩመ ነምን ምቹሳቲፍ ከዸቱ ሰነ","poem":1},{"text":"ኡቱ ነምን ዋቀ ከዸቱ ነማፍ ጅራቴ!","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"“ወጎተ ጥኖ ቦዴ፣","poem":1},{"text":"አን ገረ ዴመኒ ዴብኡን ህንጅሬ ነንዴመ።","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/JOB/16.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/JOB/17.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/JOB/15.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}